  "negative_note": "issue #27: the rail events are synchronous Slint key dispatches while the Compose side launches `scope.launch { railState.expand() }`, so the spring starts ~3ms later on the Compose clock \u2014 identical-timestamp comparison reports a systematic lead and mid-animation frame pixels disagree. The t=0 `rail_width` prop is also a Compose capture artifact: its getter reads element bounds before the first layout and reports 0 where the Slint out property already reports 96dp."
